{"schema":"SDW_SCRIPTURE_CHAPTER_V1","revision":"52add6f41edc5dd9c21f65f02f933fbd1cec266285bee8bce249607475050398","canonicalSourceHash":"f9dfbce6dd2edfe4bb3b4690acd6622f392035be2b0349df98f3607f0a05f6c2","bookId":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verses":[{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":176,"verse_start":1,"verse_end":1,"verse_label":"1","text":"My son, keep my words. Lay up my commandments within you.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":566},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":177,"verse_start":2,"verse_end":2,"verse_label":"2","text":"Keep my commandments and live! Guard my teaching as the apple of your eye.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":569},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":178,"verse_start":3,"verse_end":3,"verse_label":"3","text":"Bind them on your fingers. Write them on the tablet of your heart.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":572},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":179,"verse_start":4,"verse_end":4,"verse_label":"4","text":"Tell wisdom, “You are my sister.” Call understanding your relative,","is_omitted":0,"source_line":575},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":180,"verse_start":5,"verse_end":5,"verse_label":"5","text":"that they may keep you from the strange woman, from the foreigner who flatters with her words.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":578},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":181,"verse_start":6,"verse_end":6,"verse_label":"6","text":"For at the window of my house, I looked out through my lattice.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":581},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":182,"verse_start":7,"verse_end":7,"verse_label":"7","text":"I saw among the simple ones. I discerned among the youths a young man void of understanding,","is_omitted":0,"source_line":584},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":183,"verse_start":8,"verse_end":8,"verse_label":"8","text":"passing through the street near her corner, he went the way to her house,","is_omitted":0,"source_line":587},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":184,"verse_start":9,"verse_end":9,"verse_label":"9","text":"in the twilight, in the evening of the day, in the middle of the night and in the darkness.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":590},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":185,"verse_start":10,"verse_end":10,"verse_label":"10","text":"Behold, there a woman met him with the attire of a prostitute, and with crafty intent.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":593},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":186,"verse_start":11,"verse_end":11,"verse_label":"11","text":"She is loud and defiant. Her feet don’t stay in her house.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":596},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":187,"verse_start":12,"verse_end":12,"verse_label":"12","text":"Now she is in the streets, now in the squares, and lurking at every corner.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":599},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":188,"verse_start":13,"verse_end":13,"verse_label":"13","text":"So she caught him, and kissed him. With an impudent face she said to him:","is_omitted":0,"source_line":602},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":189,"verse_start":14,"verse_end":14,"verse_label":"14","text":"“Sacrifices of peace offerings are with me. Today I have paid my vows.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":605},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":190,"verse_start":15,"verse_end":15,"verse_label":"15","text":"Therefore I came out to meet you, to diligently seek your face, and I have found you.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":608},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":191,"verse_start":16,"verse_end":16,"verse_label":"16","text":"I have spread my couch with carpets of tapestry, with striped cloths of the yarn of Egypt.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":612},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":192,"verse_start":17,"verse_end":17,"verse_label":"17","text":"I have perfumed my bed with myrrh, aloes, and cinnamon.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":615},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":193,"verse_start":18,"verse_end":18,"verse_label":"18","text":"Come, let’s take our fill of loving until the morning. Let’s solace ourselves with loving.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":617},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":194,"verse_start":19,"verse_end":19,"verse_label":"19","text":"For my husband isn’t at home. He has gone on a long journey.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":620},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":195,"verse_start":20,"verse_end":20,"verse_label":"20","text":"He has taken a bag of money with him. He will come home at the full moon.”","is_omitted":0,"source_line":623},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":196,"verse_start":21,"verse_end":21,"verse_label":"21","text":"With persuasive words, she led him astray. With the flattering of her lips, she seduced him.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":626},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":197,"verse_start":22,"verse_end":22,"verse_label":"22","text":"He followed her immediately, as an ox goes to the slaughter, as a fool stepping into a noose.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":629},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":198,"verse_start":23,"verse_end":23,"verse_label":"23","text":"Until an arrow strikes through his liver, as a bird hurries to the snare, and doesn’t know that it will cost his life.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":633},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":199,"verse_start":24,"verse_end":24,"verse_label":"24","text":"Now therefore, sons, listen to me. Pay attention to the words of my mouth.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":638},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":200,"verse_start":25,"verse_end":25,"verse_label":"25","text":"Don’t let your heart turn to her ways. Don’t go astray in her paths,","is_omitted":0,"source_line":641},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":201,"verse_start":26,"verse_end":26,"verse_label":"26","text":"for she has thrown down many wounded. Yes, all her slain are a mighty army.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":644},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:pro","chapter":7,"verse_ordinal":202,"verse_start":27,"verse_end":27,"verse_label":"27","text":"Her house is the way to Sheol, going down to the rooms of death.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":647}]}